	(text "jaskier_door_lock variant C: two 12 V linear-actuator door locks on a socketed ESP32-C3 SuperMini,\nwith an optional RS485 (Modbus RTU) port. Docs: hardware/door-lock-c/README.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f0fc8b79-7f99-50b4-858a-2bb746d9a60e")
	)
	(text "Supply: 4S LiFePO4 house bank, 10-14.6 V. F1 1.1 A PTC, Q1 P-MOSFET reverse-polarity switch\n(R1/R2 hold Vgs at -Vin/2, inside the AO3401A's 12 V limit), D1 16 V TVS: the INA219 bus input is 26 V max.\nPS1 5 V module (SIP-3, 7805 pinout). D2 feeds the SuperMini's 5V pin, so its USB-C and the 12 V supply\nnever push into each other. The SuperMini makes the 3.3 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 264.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "aeef4f80-97db-5cdd-8ee1-974952f7aeca")
	)
	(text "Each door: VBAT -> 0.1 R shunt -> DRV8871 VM. The INA219 reads motor current and the bank voltage.\nDoor A INA219 0x40 (A1 = A0 = GND), door B 0x44 (A1 = VS). Full on/off drive only, never PWM.\nR_ILIM 56k: DRV8871 current limit 64 kV / 56k = 1.14 A, above the 0.55 A stall measured in the van.\n4.7k pull-downs keep both bridge inputs low (coast) while the ESP32 resets or is unplugged."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 281.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "198a81bc-9ef1-50c6-a200-82fec8eb4e73")
	)
	(text "Door contact input: reed or micro switch to GND (closed = door shut). 1k + 100n filter, 10k pull-up.\nUnconnected input reads high (open door). Swap M+/M- at the terminal if the bolt moves the wrong way."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 246.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b7549781-14b7-55d6-bda9-23cac52506a1")
	)
	(text "ESP32-C3 SuperMini socket (antenna at the board edge):\nIO4/IO3 door A IN1/IN2, IO5/IO6 door B IN1/IN2, IO1 door A contact, IO0 door B contact,\nIO8/IO9 I2C SDA/SCL (pulled up: both strapping pins stay high at boot),\nIO2 status LED (strapping pin, 10k pull-up), IO10 RS485 DE/RE (10k pull-down),\nIO20 RS485 RO (UART0 RX), IO21 RS485 DI (UART0 TX), IO7 spare on J7."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 233.68 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b3574e21-3aab-5b03-a88b-43d9a32f7f20")
	)
	(text "RS485, optional: Modbus RTU slave for control without Wi-Fi.\nDE/RE low at boot (R32), so the ROM boot log on IO21 never reaches the bus.\nJP1 120 ohm termination: fit a jumper cap on the last device of the bus. J4 has two A/B/GND sets for a pass-through.\nJP2/JP3 680 ohm fail-safe bias (bridge only if nothing else on the bus biases it).\nD3 SM712 clamps A and B (-7 V / +12 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 233.68 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "46dbbdf8-77e5-5ff8-9c43-68f9a93fb8ea")
	)
